# Trivy image-scan baseline acceptances.
#
# Policy: only findings with NO fix for the currently supported major line
# (i.e. requiring a major upgrade) are accepted here. Anything fixable in
# range must be upgraded, not ignored.
#
# NOTE: this repo's image scans (apko/alpine + node-pkg) report CVE ids, not
# GHSA ids. Ids below were taken verbatim from the SARIF the scanner emitted
# (run 39425573326), so they match Trivy's rule ids.
#
# The bundled npm CLI and its transitive deps were previously a finding
# source; both runner images now remove /usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm and
# corepack, so those findings are expected to be gone for good.

## Next.js — running 14.2.x, which is EOL upstream.
